    "description": "Galaxy CLO 2025-1 is Galaxy Digital's debut collateralized loan obligation, tokenized on Avalanche by INX with an initial $75M close (scalable to $200M). The CLO finances an uncommitted credit facility to Arch Lending backing consumer loans overcollateralized by bitcoin and ether, pays a senior coupon of SOFR + 5.70% monthly with initial maturity December 2026, and uses Anchorage Digital Bank as trustee and custodian with real-time collateral reporting via Accountable. The token tracks $1.00 par with principal changes effected by on-chain mint and burn. Holders are qualified investors with INX ATS listing expected.",
